# terra-siege base — Collector delivery destination + defensive turret.
# Control tower + tower top, centred on its own origin with the foot at
# y = 0. The game draws it at the platform's NE corner (BASE_TOWER_OFFSET).
# The raised landing platform, ramps, corner lights and the turret
# cap/barrel/tip are drawn procedurally — see EntityManager::renderEnemy
# (Base). Local frame: +Z forward.
# c08 tower + c15 top.
